# A recommended way out that makes another diagnostic fire is not a way out.
#
# Measured the hard way: the trait tests' own fixture was the first program to
# take the advice.
# A copy of the text, owned by whoever asked for it.
#
# It is the way out of handing a field of a borrowed subject away by value: the
# copy is the caller's and the field stays where it is.
[fn."String::clone"]
